Tunnel modifications replace the upstream server with a short-lived local
diagnostic, authenticated framing, bounded owned H264 buffers, explicit stop and
watchdogs. Only display capture, shell context initialization and codec lifecycle
patterns are adapted. Upstream audio, input, control, clipboard, file transfer,
power/settings modifications and desktop components are not included.

This is not an official scrcpy build or a claim of device compatibility.
